      "uid": "zhcn:2967d4fc3b4487522ec7d6c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看着对着夕阳大声呼喊的神业，\n一边整理着『日本杯』用的数据。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "66de0d3e031471d729f1d02d76f02c1c1d8a12e760678ab2cf5fbe4bd6e928e5",
